GAP | car_engine | NO sprite by name (no vp_engine*)
GAP | car_roof | NO sprite by name (no vp_roof*)
GAP | car_muffler_fuel_tank | NO sprite by name
GAP | pedestrian_base_body | NO base person sprite found by name search in the loose tree (only clothing / mutation / effect overlays under pngs_human_body_*): use RPG Maker characters (rmmv-www-img/characters) or build a person from brixels (arms+legs+head)
GAP | road_markings_crosswalk_curb | NO t_road / t_asphalt / t_curb / crosswalk ids; only t_pavement (+ _y centre line) and the sidewalk set
